\name{cellucid_history_tracker_rename}
\alias{cellucid_history_tracker_rename}
\title{Rename a tracker}
\usage{
cellucid_history_tracker_rename(viewer, tracker, name)
}
\arguments{
\item{viewer}{A viewer \code{\link{cellucid_view}()} or \code{\link{cellucid_serve}()} returned.}
\item{tracker}{A tracker by its name or its id (history_summary lists them). Text (at least 1 character). Required.}
\item{name}{A name, unique among its kind (compared without case and extra spaces); no length limit. Text (at least 1 character). Required.}
}
\value{
A \code{cellucid_action_request}, at once and invisibly: the action is sent now, or when the viewer's channel opens.
\code{\link{cellucid_action_result}(request)} returns its outcome: a list of \code{journal}, \code{tracker}.
}
\description{
Give a tracker another name, unique among this dataset's trackers.
}
\details{
The viewer's action \code{history.tracker.rename} (History). It moves the viewer's history, as the person's Undo, Redo or a click on a step does: it makes no step of the history.
}
\seealso{
\code{\link{cellucid_act}()} sends any action by its type, and \code{\link{cellucid_action_result}()}
